2026-07-27T05:41:36.1482055Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1547194Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1547893Z i /tmp/RtmpltuOYl/duckdb
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1548377Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1548945Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1549690Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1550466Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1551624Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1552492Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1798229Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:41:36.1908158Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:41:36.2339826Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:41:36.2499888Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
